<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-05T11:16:51.491Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 11:16:51 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed Naga militants continue fighting in Manipur's Noney district, exchanging fire and killing insurgents while seizing weapons, and a military vehicle fell into a gorge in Ladakh, killing two army personnel. The Manipur chief minister warned insurgent groups of UAPA action and ordered reports on groups linked to the attacks, while security measures were heightened on the Northern Railway at Jammu stations ahead of upcoming festivals. LG Manoj Sinha chaired a high-level meeting reviewing prison security and coordination among security agencies in Jammu and Kashmir, and a special court sentenced three CPI (Maoist) members to ten years in prison in Chhattisgarh. The conflict produced 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Indian Express&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOQnpvVDlQOU56VlpEVGtTblVvZDBYcU5zeXhWLUd5YTBWYzZGTHJTNF8xcVVRelpWY05qNllSRWptNHF3RDJhSy1aR2pzUkMtWk5QcGlKelFVd1EyMjZMbHFGRExSMjRUaG9peFdCZ1Q2U0pOLTF4cFdwQ2RvaDRLcU1tQjZ5YUM2X1Q5NlRFWUFqTXBKa1AtV3hZZ0NIWEQwbGk4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Maktoob&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQN1d2MldLY3pTNmY0YkNLcTc2M2ZOUGM1WHh0YThKVENJa1Jvc193Qm9XSmd6dXZ4X2xCaXZpSWUyUmNzQUlTSzNtMUZwc054QWRvUzM3MmFJakppNVRkdTNxeFRkNTRFek1XRmVYM3UtWGhjbFB6b0lZSUllRlB3VnJnOGhSdmxzR09FbGZwY0xXSnE3dDZTcEFScG9zSzlCRWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;EastMojo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPZUhXUzM1ck9VVG9HVFRtZlZUM3N2U2NlbXN4T1YyX0hnRFF2cFhCRzQ2SlhVMjlmX0hwUTZqdld2V1dpaXRuemZaVWFPU2E0QkpZMk90SFVmSnZucF92QVRoSC1vNnFMenE4b2NpZjh5a2I5dlQyZlJqdTVNYmpzVzRpb1U3dnN5X0JSeUVKZFl6SnF2RnpOdFEyT29Fallha1ZSYmZydHpfVUdCOFhMdjR3d2xoU0x0MXc?oc